{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_03",
  "title": "动力装甲",
  "storyCode": "DV-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "300b532e70cb9df6224cd51e377563b5d5a2f6eee384c0cd3c2c48542a125ede",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "成分解析失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "这银色液体与任何已知的化合物都不匹配。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白色结晶在她指尖凝结，迅速覆盖了整只手掌，直至半截小臂。\n你刚刚才亲眼目睹了这一幕，过去也曾无数次在战场上和作战记录里见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "钙质化？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "有敌人吗？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷娅没有回答你。\n她突然抬手，坚硬的拳头瞬间逼近你的鼻尖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一声磐石与金属碰撞的锐响，你知道是Mechanist的机械臂替你挡下了这一击。\n可你还来不及喘气，就看到一道白光抵上了自己的咽喉。\n塞雷娅的一只手的确被Mechanist挡下了，她的另一只手也没有动。\n但钙质的利刃确实架在你的脖子上。\n你下意识屏住了呼吸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "......塞雷娅，解释你的行为。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "这样更直观些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "我的源石技艺能够对周围含有钙元素的物质进行粒子层面的重构——这就是你们所称的钙质化。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "这些结成的珐琅质能直接受我的意识控制，不必跟随我的动作来移动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "我想控制它们，既不需要无线电遥控，也不需要设置自动程序。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "它们就像我手脚的延伸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "你是说那批动力甲——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "动力甲只是动力甲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "这一小管银色液体才是关键。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "它是动力甲的神经递质，是将操控者的神经活动与这具机械联系起来的媒介。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "就像......施术单元？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "它或许已经超越了一般施术单元的概念。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这个解释很直观。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我想喘口气......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "博士，如果我的做法让你感到不适的话，我向你道歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "......刚刚要不是博士冲我摆手，我的攻击目标可未必是你的拳头。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "所幸我们足够默契。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "博士，接下来我需要去见一个人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "据我所知，他是这批实验动力甲最初的使用者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
          "text": "我想请你与Mechanist先生同行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "你看见他们去了大学附近的一家酒吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "是的，女士。他们三个人都在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "我能猜到塞雷娅想去找谁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "我们上周才刚去见过他。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "那家伙？他不是在您面前信誓旦旦地说不会见任何莱茵生命的人吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "塞雷娅......她还算是莱茵生命的人吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "恐怕连她自己都不清楚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "那我们要不要阻止他们见面？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "不用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "我很好奇，塞雷娅到底掌握了多少信息......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "是时候和她聊聊了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "对了，还有......洛肯·威廉姆斯是哥伦比亚特里蒙理工大学毕业的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
          "text": "洛肯·威廉姆斯......是谁？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "......时间过得可真快，不是吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "一次实验事故，就足以令一颗学界新星坠入尘埃，从此无人知晓。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "无论如何，塞雷娅还有莱茵生命总辖也毕业于这所学校。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "哥伦比亚科技界的社交晚宴就像他们的校友聚会一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "唉，早知道这么热闹，我也该去这所学校待一段时间的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
          "text": "走吧，说不定......现在去凑凑热闹也还不算太晚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "燃烧瓶只剩最后一个了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "扔出去！尽量扔远一点！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "好——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "撤！跟着我，往里面跑！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "怎么样？都跟上来了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "呼......领队，我们的人都进来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "怪物呢？有没有跟上来？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "暂时没有。瓶子还没烧完，它们都围上去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "多谢各位。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "伤员们也都在这里了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "赫默医生，接下来该怎么办？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，出去的门——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "打不开了，这*粗口*的是怎么回事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "医生，是你关的门吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......我是第一次进入这个实验基地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "乌比卡博士？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "实验室的门是自动的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "但它锁上了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "博士......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "锁上不是正好？你们不是很怕外面的银色造物吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我们怎么知道你是想把怪物挡在外面，还是把我们关在里面？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "搞不好这都是你们计划好的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......我计划好的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "呵呵，这么说，是我控制你们绑架了我自己？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "别得意，你现在还在我们手里！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "萨姆！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，是你说的，我们都被这几个做实验的骗了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "不，别大声说话——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "赫默医生，你有没有听见......什么声音？窸窸窣窣的，就好像有东西在贴着地面滑行......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "各位，请不要停下来，也不要回头看。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "推开你们右手边的第三道门吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，门真的能打开！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不要害怕，我会保护你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......一如既往。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "......这是最新一批递质的测试结果？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
          "text": "是的，先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
          "text": "不过还只是理论结果......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "传导效率提升了百分之一点七。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "一个月过去了，很大的突破。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "你们干得非常出色。想要我给你们更多时间吗？十天，还是二十天？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
          "text": "对、对不起！呃啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "看你把这孩子吓得。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "难怪常有人说，能量科主任的夸奖比批评更恐怖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "你是特地来跟我炫耀你的人缘的吗，帕尔维斯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "我只是路过而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "可怜的孩子，你可以回实验室了。我替你陪你们主任聊聊天。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
          "text": "啊，好的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
          "text": "谢谢......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "哈哈，果然是年轻人。腿脚真快，一下就没影了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "除了主任会议以外，难得见你走出实验室。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "说吧，是什么消息让你追到了我这里？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "嗯......我想想，从哪里说起呢？瞧瞧我这可怜的脑子，年纪上去了，再让它转起来就这么费劲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "省省吧，你的白头发是天生的，卡普里尼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "哈哈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "我想起来我要问什么了——你知道缪尔赛思去哪了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "她跟我打了个赌，要是她输了，就欠我十盒生态科实验农场出品的黑豆茶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
          "text": "打赌？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
          "text": "两天前，她跟我说，你计划在这个月之内，把主任头衔从斐尔迪南·克鲁尼这个名字后面撕掉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......桑尼先生？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "你怎么不继续往前走了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "这是个错误。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "错误？哪方面的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我们不能跟着那个声音走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "那个声音......你是说弗兰克斯主任？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "桑尼先生，弗兰克斯主任是这间实验室的主人。她比我和埃琳娜更熟悉这里的构造，比如说哪个区域更加安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "就是这样，我才不能相信她！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你没发现吗？她在控制我们，她一直在这样做！她一步步引导我们的行为，渗透我们的思想......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "她想让我们全都心甘情愿地钻到她设下的牢笼里去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......桑尼先生，请冷静一些，情绪激动对你的病情没有帮助。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "离我远一些！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "唔......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "奥利维亚！你没事吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我没事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "拓荒者，我忍你们很久了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "要不是奥利维亚非要救你们，我们刚才就把你们留在外面了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "哈，谁又想跟你们进来？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我不明白......我真的不明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "多萝西明明对你们那么好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......你儿子的病好些了吗，迪克？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "不太好，弗兰克斯主任......医生说他最好要尽快动手术。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "可是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "你担心费用问题？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "唉，什么都瞒不过您。我是为了给儿子治病才加入的拓荒队，这还是我参与建设的第一个项目。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "家里早就没什么钱了，早知道我的孩子心脏有问题，我就不该浪费任何钱在矿石病的药上！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我是没希望了，但他还那么小......呜啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "不要急，迪克，我有办法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "你看，这是我认识的最好的心脏科医生的联系方式。请立刻带你儿子去找她吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "......最好的心脏科医生？在特里蒙？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那一定非常贵......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "医生是我的大学同学。请告诉她，你是多萝西·弗兰克斯的朋友。看在我的面子上，她会给你打折的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "真、真的吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "可别跟其他人说哦，减免手术费会影响这些好心的医生在市场上的身价。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "您放心！这是我们之间的秘密！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我......我走啦！您一定要替我好好感谢您的朋友！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "你在一边站那么久干什么呀，咖啡都要凉了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "凉了好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "说不定我想泼醒你的时候，就不会心疼了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "心疼我，还是心疼咖啡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "对我嬉皮笑脸可没有用，弗兰克斯主任。你再怎么跟我扮可怜，我都不会借钱给你吃饭的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "好吧，那我下个月吃速热米饭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你呀......你是莱茵生命的主任，隔三差五来蹭我一个小研究员的饭，这传出去会被人当笑话的吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "源石技艺应用科是五个科研科里最穷的啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我又不是斐尔迪南，总能拉来成堆的赞助，把自己从耳朵到尾巴都打扮得金光闪闪。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......老板的品味好歹还不错。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "好了好了，别想岔开话题。你那个同学我又不是不认识，她一听是你介绍的，大概恨不得多要个百分之十的手术费。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "反正你为了你这些拓荒者朋友，多少钱都乐意掏。这么好一个冤大头，不欺负你欺负谁呀？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "哈哈......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你就笑吧，我真是拿你没办法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "算了，我回实验室。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "为了拯救你的钱包，还是得早点做完这个实验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "她为你们做了这么多，还要我也帮忙瞒着你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你们这么对她，不觉得很过分吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "乌比卡博士，你是多萝西·弗兰克斯的朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你只看到了她想让你看到的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你不知道......她的真实目的是多么可怕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "弗兰克斯主任，我是特地来感谢您的！我儿子的手术很成功，医生说他下个星期就能出院了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "那太好了——迪克，你想不想回家看他？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "回、回家？您是说回城里去吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "可是......我是感染者，按照规定，我并不能私自进入移动城市......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "除非你们能得到一份新的工作合同，足以为你们支付那笔保险费。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "迪克，眼下就有一个机会——一个能让你摆脱既定命运的机会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "只要你签下这份知情同意书，你就能回家了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我当然......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "不，请不要着急答应。你有二十四小时的时间考虑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我不会欺骗你们，也不想有所隐瞒——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "最重要的注意事项我都帮你圈出来了，你一定要仔细看清楚那些风险。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多萝西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "有任何搞不明白的地方，随时来问我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "迪克！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领、领队？你怎么来了？你也是来报名参加......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......把这份知情同意书给我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "为什么？不，不行！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你没听明白吗？她是想把你变成关在笼子里的实验动物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那......那又怎么样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "领队，弗兰克斯主任说，我还有机会......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "“机会”这个词语，我们有多久没听见了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我并不需要二十四小时。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "为了那个再次见到孩子的可能性，我连一分钟都等不了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "就这样，她带走了迪克。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "不止迪克，还有艾伦、盖尔、索菲亚......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "她抓住了我们所有人的弱点。没有人能对她说不。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "这就是多萝西·弗兰克斯的伎俩！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "那些银色的生物就是她......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你说那些银色造物？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "它们明明......咳咳，你根本就不懂！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "两位，关于那些追着我们跑的物体，你们到底各自了解多少？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "你们一个说生物，一个说造物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "我确定自己没有听错。毕竟，在黎博利中，我们这一族的听力一贯很好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我是猜的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我也是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "这时候你们的意见倒是很一致。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "算了，无论你们眼里的多萝西到底是什么形象，至少她眼下的确在帮我们逃命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "先按照她的指示继续转移吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
          "text": "或许走廊那头的追兵能再帮你们理一理思路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
